  "finalText": "**Fixed the pagination bug.**\n\nThe `paginate` function was calculating the start index as `page * perPage`, but since pages are 1-indexed (page 1 is the first batch), it needs to be `(page - 1) * perPage`. This off-by-one error was causing every page to return the wrong rows.\n\nChanged line 7 in `paginate.js` — all 5 tests now pass.",
